## Stack Summary (2025-2026 Best Practices)

| Component | Technology | Reason |
|-----------|------------|--------|
| Framework | Next.js 13.4.19 (Pages Router) | User requirement - stable, well-documented |
| Deployment | Vercel | Native Next.js support, edge functions |
| Database | Supabase Postgres | Reliable, scalable, built-in RLS |
